# Udemy

> Udemy is a global destination for online learning, offering 250,000+ courses taught by real-world experts in business, tech, personal development, and more.

Course pages live at `/course/<slug>/`, subject hubs at `/topic/<slug>/`, and category catalogs at `/courses/<category>/`.

## Course Categories

- [Development](https://www.udemy.com/courses/development/): This page shows programming and software development courses including web, mobile, and game development.
- [IT & Software](https://www.udemy.com/courses/it-and-software/): This page shows IT certifications, network and security training, and cloud computing.
- [Finance & Accounting](https://www.udemy.com/courses/finance-and-accounting/): This page shows finance and accounting courses.
- [Business](https://www.udemy.com/courses/business/): This page shows business fundamentals, project management, communication, and leadership skills.
- [Office Productivity](https://www.udemy.com/courses/office-productivity/): View courses on Excel, PowerPoint, Google Workspace, and business productivity tools.
- [Marketing](https://www.udemy.com/courses/marketing/): This page shows digital marketing, SEO, social media strategy, and branding courses.
- [Personal Development](https://www.udemy.com/courses/personal-development/): View courses focused on productivity, goal setting, emotional intelligence, and career development.
- [Design](https://www.udemy.com/courses/design/): This page shows graphic design, UX/UI, 3D modeling, and creative software courses.
- [Music](https://www.udemy.com/courses/music/): View courses on music theory, production, instrument training, and vocal techniques.
- [Health & Fitness](https://www.udemy.com/courses/health-and-fitness/): This page shows wellness, nutrition, yoga, mental health, and fitness courses.
- [Lifestyle](https://www.udemy.com/courses/lifestyle/): View courses on cooking, pet training, gaming, travel, and other lifestyle skills.
- [Photography & Video](https://www.udemy.com/courses/photography-and-video/): This page shows photography and video production courses.
- [Teaching & Academics](https://www.udemy.com/courses/teaching-and-academics/): This page shows courses in math, science, geography, history, and other academic subjects.

